  "id": 26,
  "title": "E1and Special Showcase 《WONDE1AND》",
  "html": "\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull work-detail has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide work-detail__layout is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\t<h1 class=\"work-detail__title wp-block-post-title\">E1and Special Showcase 《WONDE1AND》</h1>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"taxonomy-work_category work-detail__categories wp-block-post-terms\"><a href=\"/work-category/live/\" rel=\"tag\">LIVE</a></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<figure data-cover-orientation=\"portrait\" class=\"work-detail__hero wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img width=\"1086\" height=\"1448\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/wonde1and-cover.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-post-image\" alt=\"E1and Special Showcase《WONDE1AND》演出海報\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/wonde1and-cover.webp 1086w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/wonde1and-cover-225x300.webp 225w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/wonde1and-cover-768x1024.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1086px) 100vw, 1086px\" /></figure>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content work-detail__post-content wp-block-post-content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-post-content-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Description</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">一場沉浸式、近距離、像踏進房間般的實驗性小專場</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">由E1and本人親自設計舞台，</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">融合樂團編制演出 + DJ形式After Party呈現出她的各種面向</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">概念取材自 Alice in Wonderland ——</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">用歌曲一首一首像揭開蕾絲帷幕般帶領著聽眾走進她最誠實的內心世界。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">訴說著對這座城市的依戀、矛盾、孤獨與靈感。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">這場演出想告訴所有曾因為不同而感到疏離的人，</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">邀請你可以在這個空間放心地感受並開心的享受。</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Credits</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>音樂總監｜陳柏豪</li>\n\n<li>電吉他｜任育萱</li>\n\n<li>木吉他｜韋仲恩</li>\n\n<li>Bass｜韋仲恩</li>\n\n<li>KB｜陳彥誠</li>\n\n<li>Programmer｜陳柏豪</li>\n\n<li>Band Leader｜陳柏豪</li>\n\n<li>音樂編曲｜陳柏豪</li>\n\n<li>編曲協力｜韋仲恩</li>\n\n<li>美術｜李彬誠</li>\n\n<li>器材支援｜puzzleman、劉可成</li>\n\n<li>硬體統籌｜杏桓有限公司</li>\n\n<li>音響工程｜撼動專業演出工程有限公司</li>\n\n<li>燈光工程｜達樂工作室</li>\n\n<li>舞台監督｜陳柏豪</li>\n\n<li>統籌顧問／後台助理｜茅以姍</li>\n\n<li>現場協力｜高弘宇、劉佩汝</li>\n\n<li>演出嘉賓｜黃若欣、羅莎莎、李紅</li>\n\n<li>技術協力｜黃詠仁</li>\n\n<li>攝影協力｜Aron、蕭裕蒼</li>\n\n<li>公關行銷｜Boris</li>\n\n<li>總監助理｜黃詠仁</li>\n\n<li>執行統籌｜Boris</li>\n\n<li>演出場地｜GOLDEN CAVE CAFE</li>\n\n<li>友情贊助｜眠豆腐 Sleepy Tofu</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"work-media\"><section class=\"work-media__section work-media-gallery\" aria-labelledby=\"work-media-gallery-26\"><h2 id=\"work-media-gallery-26\" class=\"work-media__heading\">Gallery</h2><div class=\"work-media-gallery__grid\"><figure class=\"work-media-gallery__item\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1Ow40s0r5HQH8KxNDkNJexhgjBg3mO5mc-1024x683.webp\" class=\"work-media-gallery__image\" alt=\"E1and Special Showcase 《WONDE1AND》 — _A7R7263.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1Ow40s0r5HQH8KxNDkNJexhgjBg3mO5mc-1024x683.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1Ow40s0r5HQH8KxNDkNJexhgjBg3mO5mc-300x200.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1Ow40s0r5HQH8KxNDkNJexhgjBg3mO5mc-768x512.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1Ow40s0r5HQH8KxNDkNJexhgjBg3mO5mc-1536x1024.webp 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1Ow40s0r5HQH8KxNDkNJexhgjBg3mO5mc-2048x1365.webp 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure><figure class=\"work-media-gallery__item\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"/wp-content/uploa